WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:17.635
The next day the cast and crew met inside the auditorium after school.

2
00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:22.197
"I'm so excited to start rehearsing," Ben said.

3
00:00:22.917 --> 00:00:23.697
Mog nodded.

4
00:00:23.717 --> 00:00:24.778
"Me too."

5
00:00:25.578 --> 00:00:28.900
Mr. Freaky hurried onstage, wringing his hands.

6
00:00:29.728 --> 00:00:34.191
"Before you begin rehearsals, I just want to say that everyone must behave for Ms.

7
00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:40.856
Lafang. I want this to be the best show Monster Academy has ever produced!"

8
00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:43.837
"Mr. Freaky looks nervous," Winnie whispered.

9
00:00:43.858 --> 00:00:46.759
"I wonder if he knows this play is cursed."

10
00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:49.001
"I doubt it," Ben said.

11
00:00:49.021 --> 00:00:51.883
"This play is cursed," Mr.

12
00:00:51.943 --> 00:00:52.643
Freaky said.

13
00:00:52.663 --> 00:00:54.685
Ozzy pumped his fist.

14
00:00:54.705 --> 00:00:59.348
"Yes!" "Things must not get out of control!"

15
00:00:59.728 --> 00:01:00.808
Mr. Freaky said.

16
00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:02.509
"Thank you, Mr.

17
00:01:02.589 --> 00:01:04.249
Freaky," Victoria said.

18
00:01:04.269 --> 00:01:07.650
"Monsters, we have a short time to get ready.

19
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.371
We must work hard.

20
00:01:09.891 --> 00:01:12.812
From this moment forward, we are a family.

21
00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:15.132
Now let's begin!

22
00:01:15.552 --> 00:01:16.913
Who's my stage manager?"

23
00:01:16.933 --> 00:01:18.413
"I am."

24
00:01:19.814 --> 00:01:21.014
Jen hurried toward her.

25
00:01:21.034 --> 00:01:25.915
"Wonderful! We'll begin with Lady Macdeath's monologue.

26
00:01:26.395 --> 00:01:27.136
Ready, Gaby?"

27
00:01:27.156 --> 00:01:29.884
"Yes." Gaby smiled.

28
00:01:29.904 --> 00:01:32.805
"I already have my lines memorized."

29
00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.546
"Ugh," Ben thought.

30
00:01:36.066 --> 00:01:38.027
"I haven't even started trying to learn mine yet.

31
00:01:38.507 --> 00:01:40.187
It's going to take me forever."

32
00:01:41.928 --> 00:01:45.369
While Gaby began rehearsing, Ben floated over to Winnie.

33
00:01:46.009 --> 00:01:50.310
She and a few other stage crew monsters were discussing costumes and props.

34
00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:54.232
"Hey, Winnie, can you help me memorize my lines?"

35
00:01:54.612 --> 00:01:55.412
Ben asked.

36
00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.021
"Sorry, Ben.

37
00:01:57.541 --> 00:02:00.242
We're trying to figure out a design for the witches' cauldron.

38
00:02:01.323 --> 00:02:03.264
Victoria wants it to be really special."

39
00:02:05.926 --> 00:02:07.747
Ben spotted Jen rushing by.

40
00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:08.847
"Hey, Jen!

41
00:02:08.887 --> 00:02:11.429
Can you—" "Sorry, Ben," Jen said.

42
00:02:11.449 --> 00:02:14.811
"Ms. Lafang needs me to get something for her."

43
00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:23.596
Ben found Mog backstage, swinging his sword.

44
00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.254
"Can you help me memorize my lines?"

45
00:02:27.654 --> 00:02:28.435
Ben asked.

46
00:02:28.455 --> 00:02:30.777
"Sure," Mog said.

47
00:02:30.797 --> 00:02:32.918
"I already memorized mine."

48
00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:35.401
"You did?"

49
00:02:35.941 --> 00:02:36.582
Ben said.

50
00:02:37.783 --> 00:02:38.683
Mog shrugged.

51
00:02:38.703 --> 00:02:41.726
"I only have three lines."

52
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:47.051
Ben heard Gaby going through her lines in a loud voice.

53
00:02:47.071 --> 00:02:49.573
"'Out, out darned spot!'"

54
00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:53.076
She stomped her foot, causing the stage to shake.

55
00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:55.697
"Nice work, Gaby!"

56
00:02:56.158 --> 00:02:57.058
Victoria called.

57
00:02:57.078 --> 00:03:02.242
"But as I said yesterday, remember to keep your emotions in check.

58
00:03:03.543 --> 00:03:05.704
Let's run through the witches' scene now.

59
00:03:06.705 --> 00:03:08.286
Where's our temporary cauldron?"

60
00:03:08.306 --> 00:03:09.667
"Here, Ms.

61
00:03:09.707 --> 00:03:13.089
Lafang." Winnie hurried over with a large flowerpot.

62
00:03:13.109 --> 00:03:16.731
"Um, Ms.

63
00:03:16.751 --> 00:03:18.693
Lafang?" Mog called out.

64
00:03:18.713 --> 00:03:21.615
"When do I get to fight Macdeath?"

65
00:03:22.916 --> 00:03:26.289
"Shh!" Victoria Lafang swung around to Mog.

66
00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:31.272
"Didn't I tell you—never say that name in the theater!

67
00:03:31.912 --> 00:03:33.573
You'll give us all bad luck."

68
00:03:34.674 --> 00:03:37.135
"Oh sorry, I forgot," Mog mumbled.

69
00:03:37.155 --> 00:03:43.218
"Now go straight outside, spin in a circle three times, spit three times, then knock on the door

70
00:03:43.298 --> 00:03:44.939
and ask to be allowed back in."

71
00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.620
Mog's face lit up.

72
00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:50.822
"Did you just tell me to spit?"

73
00:03:51.663 --> 00:03:53.344
"Yes, three times!"

74
00:03:53.704 --> 00:03:54.745
Victoria repeated.

75
00:03:54.765 --> 00:03:58.407
"Everyone else, take your places for the witches' scene."

76
00:03:58.427 --> 00:04:01.549
"Acting is awesome!"

77
00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:02.570
Mog said.

78
00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:06.713
After Mog left, the three witches gathered around the cauldron.

79
00:04:07.874 --> 00:04:11.276
Victoria gave them a few tips, and then they began.

80
00:04:11.296 --> 00:04:14.578
"'Double, double toil and trouble.

81
00:04:15.018 --> 00:04:21.103
Fire burn and cauldron—'" A loud pounding came from the doors.

82
00:04:21.123 --> 00:04:22.944
"Can I come in?"

83
00:04:23.324 --> 00:04:24.025
Mog shouted.

84
00:04:24.045 --> 00:04:25.526
"Hold up!"

85
00:04:25.886 --> 00:04:26.927
Victoria shouted.

86
00:04:26.947 --> 00:04:29.429
"Jen, please open the door for Mog.

87
00:04:30.209 --> 00:04:36.614
Witches, let's take it from She lowered her voice and whispered, "You-know-who's entrance."

88
00:04:36.634 --> 00:04:37.955
"Got it!"

89
00:04:38.575 --> 00:04:39.956
Jen came backstage.

90
00:04:40.357 --> 00:04:41.758
She stopped and looked at Ben.

91
00:04:41.778 --> 00:04:43.739
"She means you, Ben.

92
00:04:44.259 --> 00:04:48.322
She's just not saying your character's name because of the superstition."

93
00:04:48.342 --> 00:04:53.038
"Oh!" Ben chuckled and then floated toward the stage.

94
00:04:53.719 --> 00:04:55.621
Two zombies were playing his guards.

95
00:04:56.121 --> 00:04:56.942
They followed him.

96
00:04:58.743 --> 00:04:59.904
One zombie slipped.

97
00:05:00.325 --> 00:05:02.467
She stumbled into the other zombie.

98
00:05:03.047 --> 00:05:06.691
The two of them slammed into Ben, knocking him to the floor.

99
00:05:06.711 --> 00:05:08.812
"What happened?"

100
00:05:09.173 --> 00:05:10.134
Victoria shouted.

101
00:05:10.154 --> 00:05:12.436
"Everything's fine!"

102
00:05:13.637 --> 00:05:14.998
Ben brushed himself off.

103
00:05:16.199 --> 00:05:16.960
But it wasn't.

104
00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.503
His script was completely covered in zombie drool.

105
00:05:20.523 --> 00:05:23.325
"Ugh," he murmured.

106
00:05:23.345 --> 00:05:28.009
"Ben, come out here and take it from your first line," Victoria said.

107
00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.753
Ben grabbed his wet script and floated toward the witches.

108
00:05:32.773 --> 00:05:41.700
"'So foul and fair He glanced down at his script to see what came next, but the words

109
00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:42.701
were all smudged.

110
00:05:43.481 --> 00:05:46.444
Then Ben floated right into a stage curtain.

111
00:05:50.596 --> 00:05:51.937
"What are you doing?"

112
00:05:52.538 --> 00:05:53.718
Jade glared at him.

113
00:05:53.738 --> 00:05:56.521
"Sorry, I wasn't looking where I was going."

114
00:05:56.901 --> 00:06:01.124
Ben tried to float out the other side of the curtain, but he couldn't move.

115
00:06:01.144 --> 00:06:04.606
"Look!" Lucy laughed and pointed.

116
00:06:04.626 --> 00:06:06.908
"Ben's stuck!"

117
00:06:07.609 --> 00:06:09.550
The other two witches laughed too.

118
00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:15.274
"That's enough, girls," Victoria said sharply.

119
00:06:15.795 --> 00:06:16.795
Then she sighed.

120
00:06:18.404 --> 00:06:20.286
"I think we're done for today, monsters.

121
00:06:20.826 --> 00:06:22.568
We'll continue on Saturday morning.

122
00:06:23.188 --> 00:06:25.911
Everyone, go home and study those scripts!"

123
00:06:26.631 --> 00:06:31.636
Ben hung his head, too embarrassed to move until everyone else had left the stage.

124
00:06:31.656 --> 00:06:36.520
"That was so weird," he thought.

125
00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:39.963
He hadn't gotten stuck like this in a long time.

126
00:06:40.503 --> 00:06:41.644
Why was it happening now?

127
00:06:42.445 --> 00:06:47.964
Then it struck him—it could be the curse of Macdeath!

128
00:06:47.985 --> 00:06:49.369
"No way," Ben said aloud.

129
00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:52.019
"It's just my own rotten luck."
